// THE NAME-TO-PATH RULE, asked directly: the pending census walks the directory THAT RULE resolves a
// trigger's module to (see recovery_trigger_pool_roots), so the population is derived from the trigger,
// never from a hand-kept list of directories this file could quietly keep stale.
